      "administering_agency": "San Luis Obispo County Housing Trust Fund, 71 Zaca Lane Suite 130, San Luis Obispo, 805-543-5970 (Kathy McClenathen, Deputy Director)",
      "funding_type": "loan",
      "typical_award_size": "Notice of Funding Available updated April 1, 2026: up to $3 million available, maximum loan $3 million per project, term generally up to 5 years, 5% to 7% fixed interest, 1% to 2% fees plus costs, real estate collateral (may be subordinate), loan-to-value 80% to 100% including senior debt. LIHTC Project Loans (soft, 15-year or longer, from LHTF and PLHA grant funds): up to $40,000 per extremely low income unit and $20,000 per low income unit, $1.5 million per project. Since 2003: 70 loans over $44 million for 1,700 units; $5.9 million closed in 2024 with $20 million outstanding.",
      "per_unit_cap": "$40,000 per ELI unit and $20,000 per LI unit on LIHTC Project Loans; $1.5 million per project for longer-term loans; $3 million per project overall.",
